{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115121105793-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115121425\"/><p>珀麗灣巴士總站，有雙層巴士撼假天花。</p><p>馬灣發生交通意外。今晨（15日）10時52分，一輛來往葵芳站及珀麗灣的路線332號雙層巴士，駛進珀麗灣巴士總站時，車頭撼到假天花，車頭擋風玻璃爆裂，幸沒有人受傷。意外原因有待調查。</p><p>據了解，今次已是珀麗灣巴士4日內第2宗交通意外，上周二(10日)，一輛珀麗灣雙層巴士在葵芳撞到閘口，撞花左邊車身，玻璃窗爆裂。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T04:35:31.899494+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T04:11:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T15:36:42.295961+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T04:29:03.074636+00:00","content_hash":"748685f016429e310206953bb39d97a22f48aa2df2b4954bd8e53fdd52b154bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T04:35:31.899494+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}